<title>FINLAND: HARTWALL 8-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 140 MLN.</title>
<headline>HARTWALL 8-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 140 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Aug 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		   139.8 vs 42.4</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	     7.27 vs 1.97</p>
<p> Net sales				    1,339 vs 1,210</p>
<p> Operating profit			   163.4 vs 68.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast profit after financial</p>
<p>items was 80 million markka (mean 86 million) in a 58 million to</p>
<p>122 million markka range.</p>
<p> Depreciation				  76.9 vs 115.3</p>
<p> Net financial items		charge 23.6 vs 25.5 charge</p>
<p> Minorities			   charge 17.3 vs 11.7 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					   43.1 vs 13.3</p>
<p> Net profit				    79.2 vs 12.4</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	41.6 vs 25.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish beverages company is Oy Hartwall</p>
<p>Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0240</p>
</text>
